WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
One verse of the Qur'an names five
things a believer must never deny.

2
00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.640
Sunni Muslims summarise
their faith as six articles.

3
00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:12.430
Shi'a Muslims summarise the
foundations as five roots:

4
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.960
the Usul ad-Din.

5
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:18.260
Put the two lists side by side,
and they don't quite line up.

6
00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:22.420
So do Sunni and Shi'a Muslims
really believe different things?

7
00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:26.690
In this mission, you'll set the Sunni
articles and the Shi'a roots next to each

8
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.860
other and compare them, belief by belief.

9
00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.540
Then you'll weigh up a claim: that the
differences between Sunni and Shi'a beliefs

10
00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.240
matter more than the similarities.

11
00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:42.610
Your mission: find out whether Sunni and
Shi'a Muslims really hold different beliefs.
